// Classic ESP32 + WS2812B/WS281x + BLE
// - true 3-color engine: BG / FG / MAIN
// - runtime RGB byte-order mapping: RGB/GRB/BRG/GBR/RBG/BGR
// - audio is an input layer, not a separate effect selector
// - current effect can be modulated by level/beat/spectrum/full audio
